PR #175  overall: potential_risk
Spec: IOPMP Multi-Fault Record deduplication: subsequent violations from the same RRID were conditionally skipped via checkRridSv(), causing loss of fault telemetry that could conceal multi-stage or repeated access-violation attacks from a single requester.
  [OK] drivers/clk/thead/clk-th1520-ap.c:1250-1261  CCU_GATE (macro invocations)
